                         ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyContentParaSlot ; Privacy Policy Content ParaSlot ; true  ; PrivacyPolicyIntroductionParaComponent1,PrivacyPolicyCookiesnTrackingComponent,PrivacyPolicyNoticeParaComponent,PrivacyPolicyChoiceParaComponent,PrivacyPolicySecurityParaComponent,PrivacyPolicyAccuracyParaComponent,PrivacyPolicyThirdPartyServicesParaComponent,PrivacyPolicyChildrensPrivacyParaComponent,PrivacyPolicyCommitmentParaComponent,PrivacyPolicyConsentParaComponent


INSERT_UPDATE CMSParagraphComponent; $contentCV[unique = true]; uid[unique = true]                           ; &componentRef                                ; name                                                    ; content
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyHeadingParaComponent            ; PrivacyPolicyHeadingParaComponent            ; Privacy Policy Heading Paragraph Component              ; <h2>Privacy Policy<h2>
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyIntroductionParaComponent1      ; PrivacyPolicyIntroductionParaComponent1      ; Privacy Policy Introduction Paragraph Component         ; <h1>Introduction</h1><p>We at WholeScripts are committed to respecting your online privacy and recognize your need for appropriate protection and management of any personally identifiable information ("Personal Information") you share with us.</p><p>WholeScripts has established this Online Privacy Policy so that you can understand the care with which we intend to treat your Personal Information.</p><p>Personal Information means any information that may be used to identify an individual, including, but not limited to, a first and last name, a home or other physical address, and an email address or other contact information, whether at work or at home. In general, you can visit WholeScripts' web pages without telling us who you are or revealing any Personal Information about yourself.</p><p>If you choose to provide us with your Personal Information on the web, we may transfer that Information within WholeScripts or to WholeScripts' third-party service providers, across borders, and from your country or jurisdiction to other countries or jurisdictions around the world.</p><p>WholeScripts strives to comply with all applicable laws around the globe that are designed to protect your privacy. Although legal requirements may vary from country to country, WholeScripts intends to adhere to the principles set forth in this Online Privacy Policy even if, in connection with the above, we transfer your Personal Information from your country to countries that may not require an "adequate" level of protection for your Personal Information. In other words, our goal is to provide protection for your Personal Information no matter where that Personal Information is collected, transferred, or retained.</p>
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyCookiesnTrackingComponent       ; PrivacyPolicyCookiesnTrackingComponent       ; Privacy Policy tracking Paragraph Component             ; <h2>Cookies and Other Tracking Technologies</h2><p>Some of our web pages utilize "cookies" and other tracking technologies. A "cookie" is a small text file that may be used, for example, to collect information about website activity. Some cookies and other technologies may serve to recall Personal Information previously indicated by a web user. Most browsers allow you to control cookies, including whether or not to accept them and how to remove them. You may set most browsers to notify you if you receive a cookie, or you may choose to block cookies with your browser, but please note that if you choose to erase or block your cookies, you will need to re-enter your original user ID and password to gain access to certain parts of the website. Tracking technologies may record information such as Internet domain and host names, Internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser software and operating system types, clickstream patterns, and dates and times that our site is accessed. Our use of cookies and other tracking technologies allows us to improve our website and your web experience. We may also analyze information that does not contain Personal Information for trends and statistics.</p><h2>To protect your privacy, we have adopted the following principles:</h2><ul><li>Notice</li><li>Choice</li><li>Security</li><li>Access/Accuracy</li></ul>
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyNoticeParaComponent             ; PrivacyPolicyNoticeParaComponent             ; Privacy Policy Notice Paragraph Component               ; "<h2>Notice</h2><p>Where WholeScripts collects Personal Information on the web, we intend to post a purpose statement that explains why Personal Information will be collected and whether we plan to share such Personal Information outside of WholeScripts or those working on WholeScripts' behalf. WholeScripts does not intend to transfer Personal Information without your consent to third parties who are not bound to act on WholeScripts' behalf unless such transfer is legally required.</p>"
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyChoiceParaComponent             ; PrivacyPolicyChoiceParaComponent             ; Privacy Policy Choice Paragraph Component               ; "<h2>Choice</h2><p>You may choose whether or not to provide Personal Information to WholeScripts. The notice we intend to provide where WholeScripts collects Personal Information on the web should help you to make this choice. If you choose not to provide the Personal Information we request, you can still visit most of WholeScripts' websites, but you may be unable to access certain options, offers, and services that involve our interaction with you.</p><p>If you choose to have a relationship with WholeScripts, such as a contractual or other business relationship or partnership, we will naturally continue to contact you in connection with that business relationship.</p>"
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicySecurityParaComponent           ; PrivacyPolicySecurityParaComponent           ; Privacy Policy Security Paragraph Component             ; "<h2>Security</h2><p>Wherever your Personal Information may be held within WholeScripts or on its behalf, we intend to take reasonable and appropriate steps to protect the Personal Information that you share with us from unauthorized access or disclosure.</p>"
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyAccuracyParaComponent           ; PrivacyPolicyAccuracyParaComponent           ; Privacy Policy Accuracy Paragraph Component             ; <h2>Access/Accuracy</h2><p>To the extent that you do provide us with Personal Information, WholeScripts wishes to maintain accurate Personal Information. Where we collect Personal Information from you on the web, our goal is to provide a means of contacting WholeScripts should you need to update or correct that Information. If for any reason those means are unavailable or inaccessible, you may send updates and corrections about your Personal Information to <a href="mailto:privacy@WholeScripts.com">privacy@WholeScripts.com</a>, and we will make reasonable efforts to incorporate the changes in your Personal Information that we hold as soon as practicable.</p>
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyThirdPartyServicesParaComponent ; PrivacyPolicyThirdPartyServicesParaComponent ; Privacy Policy Third Party Services Paragraph Component ; "<h2>Third Party Services</h2><p>Third parties provide certain services available on WholeScripts.com on WholeScripts' behalf. WholeScripts may provide information, including Personal Information, that WholeScripts collects on the web to third-party service providers to help us deliver programs, products, information, and services. Service providers are also an important means by which WholeScripts maintains its website and mailing lists. WholeScripts will take reasonable steps to ensure that these third-party service providers are obligated to protect Personal Information on WholeScripts' behalf.</p><p>WholeScripts does not intend to transfer Personal Information without your consent to third parties who are not bound to act on WholeScripts' behalf unless such transfer is legally required. Similarly, it is against WholeScripts' policy to sell Personal Information collected online without consent.</p>"
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyChildrensPrivacyParaComponent   ; PrivacyPolicyChildrensPrivacyParaComponent   ; Privacy Policy Children's Privacy Paragraph Component   ; "<h2>Children's Privacy</h2><p>WholeScripts.com is not structured to attract children. Accordingly, we do not intend to collect Personal Information from anyone we know to be under 13 years of age.</p>"
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyCommitmentParaComponent         ; PrivacyPolicyCommitmentParaComponent         ; Privacy Policy Commitment Paragraph Component           ; <h2>Commitment</h2><p>We are committed to privacy and, through our membership in the Online Privacy Alliance, are actively involved in and support current industry initiatives to preserve individual privacy rights on the Internet. Protecting your privacy online is an evolving area, and WholeScripts' websites are constantly evolving to meet these demands.</p><p>If you have any comments or questions regarding our Online Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@WholeScripts.com">info@WholeScripts.com</a>. While we cannot guarantee privacy perfection, we will address any issue to the best of our abilities as soon as possible.</p>
                                   ;                          ; PrivacyPolicyConsentParaComponent            ; PrivacyPolicyConsentParaComponent            ; Privacy Policy Consent Paragraph Component              ; "<h2>Your Consent</h2><p>By using this website, you consent to the terms of our Online Privacy Policy and to WholeScripts' processing of Personal Information for the purposes given above as well as those explained where WholeScripts collects Personal Information on the web. Should the Online Privacy Policy change, we intend to take every reasonable step to ensure that these changes are brought to your attention by posting all changes prominently on our website for a reasonable period of time.</p>"


######################## CCW-304-Privacy-Policy END ##############################################################

