#################### CCW-345 FAQ Question ANSWER Start########################
INSERT_UPDATE WholescriptsFaq; uid[unique = true]         ; question[lang = $lang]                                                                                                      ; answer[lang = $lang]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           ; allGroups(uid)
# general faq
                             ; faqGeneralQus1             ; What makes WholeScripts different from other nutritional supplement ordering sites?                                         ; "The formulas available on WholeScripts have been used and trusted by thousands of practitioners and patients nationwide for over 20 years. It is the place to find genuine XYMOGEN formulas, learn more about all our offerings, and allows registered healthcare practitioners to create customized MedPax for their patients.WholeScripts also offers EMR/EHR integration to make recommending supplements easier and quicker for practitioners."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqGeneralQus2             ; Why are the majority of WholeScripts’ formulas, XYMOGEN formulas?                                                           ; "XYMOGEN powers WholeScripts. The majority of formulas are manufactured by XYMOGEN because cutting-edge science, testing, and data are employed in the making of XYMOGEN formulas. Also, XYMOGEN’s quality is backed by its ePedigree program, which ensures that what it says on the label is in the bottle."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqGeneralQus3             ; Are there any known drug-nutrient interactions with any of the formulas available at WholeScripts?                          ; "Yes, there are known and possibly unknown interactions between some prescription and over-the-counter (OTC) medications and some dietary supplements. The combination may enhance the drug’s action and therefore increase risk of toxicity, or it may reduce the drug’s action and therefore decrease its benefit. A drug can also deplete certain nutrients and increase the need for supplementation. The information supplied on labels regarding specific interactions is limited to the research available and the likely impact to the general public, so it is important to consult with your healthcare practitioner or pharmacist before combining prescription or OTC medications with any nutraceutical formulas available through WholeScripts." ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqGeneralQus4             ; Do you have formulas designed to address particular body systems or health concerns?                                        ; "Yes, you can view our formulas, which have been categorized according to body systems and health concerns, on our formulas page."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqGeneralQus5             ; Do you have any supplements specifically formulated for children?                                                           ; "Yes, we have XYMOGEN’s BrainSustain™ for Kids, a powdered drink formula designed to enhance children’s brain development and performance.* Many healthcare practitioners recommend this and other WholeScripts supplements in an effort to support children’s overall health. WholeScripts has these formulas and more. Very few clinical trials are carried out on children, so there is limited data with which to assess the safety and efficacy of nutraceuticals for children. We recommend that you consult a licensed healthcare practitioner before giving your child any formula available through WholeScripts."                                                                                                                                    ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqGeneralQus6             ; Do you offer any discounts on products?                                                                                     ; "Yes, make sure you check out our website and newsletter for promotions. Also, don't forget to follow us on social media."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup

# Orders faq
                             ; faqOrdersQus1              ; What happens when my product is on backorder?                                                                               ; "You will have an open order for the product. Once the product is back in stock, we will automatically ship it out to you as soon as possible."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqOrdersQus2              ; When can I expect my backorder?                                                                                             ; "Every backorder product may have a different ETA. Any date we might provide is an estimate and is not guaranteed. Please call us at <a href='tel:+18006476100'>1-800-647-6100</a>, email us at <a href='mailto:info@wholescripts.com'>info@wholescripts.com</a>, or chat with us."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqOrdersQus3              ; What are some of the reasons for products to be on backorder?                                                               ; "Some of the reasons are raw material supply issues, vendor Issues, and testing delays just to name a few."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqOrdersQus4              ; When will I get charged for my backorder?                                                                                   ; "Your card may authorize 2-5 business days before the item ships. You will not be charged for the back-ordered formula until it ships."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqOrdersQus5              ; Will I be notified when my backorder is released?                                                                           ; "If the back-ordered item has been on backorder for less than a month, you will not be notified when the backorder is released. If the back-ordered item is on back order for more than a month, you will receive an email 7-14 days before your backorder is released."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqOrdersQus6              ; What if I don’t want the back-ordered product?                                                                              ; "You can cancel at any time through your WholeScripts.com account. We can also assist you in canceling your backorders at <a href='tel:+18006476100'>1-800-647-6100</a>, email us at <a href='mailto:info@wholescripts.com'>info@wholescripts.com</a> or chat with us on WholeScripts.com."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
# Practitioners faq
                             ; faqPractitionersQus1       ; Will I earn SharedRewards for brands other than XYMOGEN?                                                                    ; "Yes! Half the retail price of all your patients’ purchases, even of other brands, will go towards your SharedRewards."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqPractitionersQus2       ; I am a licensed healthcare practitioner. How do I order XYMOGEN nutritional formulas?                                       ; "Licensed healthcare practitioners who would like to offer XYMOGEN formulas may apply for an account <a href='https://www.wholescripts.com/register-practitioner'>here</a>. The application will be reviewed and further documentation may be requested. Not all applicants will be approved; WholeScripts will review the license, certificate, and practitioner designation to see if it meets its requirements."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqPractitionersQus3       ; What's a wire transfer or ACH transfer?                                                                                     ; "A wire transfer and ACH transfer are electronic payment services initiated by the customer through their banking institution or another service provider."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqPractitionersQus4       ; If I select to pay with a wire transfer, ACH transfer, or by mail, what's next?                                             ; "You need to check your Order History to confirm the order number and correct payment amount you need to send. Once payment is applied you will receive your order confirmation via email."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqPractitionersQus5       ; Why should I check my Order History before I send the payment?                                                              ; "The payment amount from the checkout is an estimate while the Order History details has the final amount after the order has been adjusted (regional/state taxes and fees) and processed. The total may be the same."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqPractitionersQus6       ; If paying by wire transfer or ACH, what's your bank information?                                                            ; "Bank: Bank of America, NA <br>Account Number: 898090101749<br> Wire Number: 026009593<br> ACH Number: 063100277<br> <br>Note: Please include the order number in the memo area"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqPractitionersQus7       ; If paying by mail, where should I mail the check?                                                                           ; "Pay to: WholeScripts, LLC - Accounts Receivable<br> Address: 6900 Kingspointe Pkwy, Orlando, FL 32819<br> <br>Note: Please include the order number in the memo area"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqPractitionersQus8       ; Should I include the order number when I wire transfer or mail my check?                                                    ; "Yes. It is required as it is the only way we can confirm your order. Please include the order number in the memo area when wire-transferring or mailing your check."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqPractitionersQus9       ; My order got canceled. I wire-transferred/mailed the payment.                                                               ; "Your order may have been canceled because we didn't receive the payment within 5 to 7 business days. We can reverse the cancellation at any time after payment is received. It is the customer’s responsibility to contact Wholescripts if a rejected order needs to be reinstated"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
#Patients FAQ
                             ; faqPatientsQus1            ; I'm a patient. How do I order XYMOGEN nutritional formulas?                                                                 ; "You're in the right place. XYMOGEN formulas can be purchased through a recommendation from a licensed healthcare practitioner.<a href='/accounts-settings/FindAPractitioner'>Click here to find one in your area.</a>"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqPatientsQus2            ; I bought a product recommended by my healthcare practitioner, but I was not satisfied and want to return it. What can I do? ; "Because WholeScripts rigorously tests all its formulas for authenticity, potency, and safety—and we do not resell any returned items—we are unable to accept returns. Claims for shortages, incorrect items, and damages must be made within (5) days of delivery and will be reviewed on a case-by-case basis."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqPatientsQus3            ; Can I take formulas available through WholeScripts if I am pregnant or lactating?                                           ; " Many dietary ingredients have not been tested during pregnancy or lactation. It is always best to check the label cautions and consult your healthcare practitioner before using a dietary supplement of any kind while pregnant or lactating."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
#XYMOGEN FAQ
                             ; faqXYMOGENQus1             ; Is everything in a XYMOGEN formula listed on the label?                                                                     ; "Yes. Everything listed on a XYMOGEN label is present in the capsule, tablet, powder, or liquid. What you see is exactly what you get."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqXYMOGENQus2             ; Where does XYMOGEN source its ingredients?                                                                                  ; "That is completely dependent on what supplier has the best material. It is one of our highest priorities to search out the best raw materials for XYMOGEN products based on quality, purity, and research."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqXYMOGENQus3             ; Where are XYMOGEN’s supplements manufactured?                                                                               ; "A majority of XYMOGEN formulas are manufactured at our 308,400–square–foot headquarters and manufacturing facility in Orlando, FL. However, the manufacturing of some XYMOGEN formulas is outsourced to a few select companies. We require that each of these companies, including XYMOGEN itself, is currently Good Manufacturing Practice (GMP) registered by the National Sanitation Foundation (NSF International)."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqXYMOGENQus4             ; Do XYMOGEN products contain common allergens?                                                                               ; "The FDA requires that all dietary supplements and foods containing one of the major 8 allergens (milk, egg, peanut, tree nut, wheat, soy, fish, and crustacean shellfish) be labeled to detail which allergen it contains. While XYMOGEN generally tries to avoid the use of the major 8 allergens and other allergenic materials such as corn protein, yeast, and gluten; the label is the best place to obtain what allergens are present in a formula. If you have allergenic responses to ingredients not listed on the ‘Does Not Contain’ section of the label or that is not a Major 8 Allergen that would be clearly listed, we recommend conferring with your healthcare practitioner on whether a WholeScripts formula is for you."                  ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqXYMOGENQus5             ; Are there inactive ingredients in XYMOGEN formulas?                                                                         ; "Inactive or other ingredients are present in our formulas for a variety of reasons including: encapsulation, achieving uniform density for accurate dosing, and dispersing the active ingredients evenly. All ingredients in XYMOGEN formulas are generally recognized as safe (GRAS)."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqXYMOGENQus6             ; Have XYMOGEN bovine-sourced products been tested for mad cow disease?                                                       ; "XYMOGEN requires that all bovine-sourced ingredients are free of both bovine spongiform encephalopathy (BSE) and transmissible spongiform encephalopthathy (TSE), more commonly referred to as “mad cow disease”."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqXYMOGENQus7             ; Should I take my XYMOGEN supplements with meals?                                                                            ; "If there is a clear, science-based reason to take your supplement away from a meal, this will be indicated on the XYMOGEN formula label directions or in the formula Doctor’s Reference Sheet (DRS). If there is any remaining question, consult your healthcare practitioner."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
#MEDPAX FAQ
                             ; faqMedpaxQus1              ; What is MedPax?                                                                                                             ; "MedPax is convenient, personalized nutritional and/or herbal supplements measured and packaged in convenient go-anywhere dose packs. MedPax alleviates the need for multiple bottles and individual dosing recommendations for each supplement."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqMedpaxQus2              ; How does MedPax work?                                                                                                       ; "Patients can select the supplements they want and the dosing for each or receive a customized protocol from you. Likewise, you can use a predetermined protocol based on recommendations from WholeScripts’ medical teams for specific health concerns. Practitioner-recommended MedPax are emailed to patients. Your patient clicks accept, pays for their supplements, and gets them sent directly."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqMedpaxQus3              ; Can MedPax be renewed or sent monthly?                                                                                      ; "Yes. MedPax includes an autoship option that automatically ships supplements every 30 or 60 days, depending on the interval the patient chooses. Patients can cancel autoship at any time."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqMedpaxQus4              ; What can be included in MedPax?                                                                                             ; "MedPax can include any XYMOGEN capsule, tablet, and softgel formula, as well as a selection of WholeScript products."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqMedpaxQus5              ; How long do the supplements in MedPax last?                                                                                 ; "Use all MedPax supplements within 60 days for the best potency and freshness."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
#MEDPAX PRACTITIONERS CHILD FAQ
                             ; faqMedpaxPractitionersQus1 ; Does MedPax increase patient compliance?                                                                                    ; "Yes. Patients who use MedPax stick with their protocol, and when they opt for autoship, surveys show that they are 300 times more likely to comply with the recommended protocol."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqMedpaxPractitionersQus2 ; Can patients stock up on their MedPax?                                                                                      ; "Patients should use all MedPax supplements within 60 days for the best potency and freshness."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqMedpaxPractitionersQus3 ; Can I Private Label MedPax?                                                                                                 ; "Yes. We encourage practitioners to Private Label MedPax. There is a fee for Private Label requests. But many practitioners say the branding benefit was well worth it in repeat orders."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqMedpaxPractitionersQus4 ; How does MedPax help my practice?                                                                                           ; "It saves you space: No more warehousing all those supplements in your clinic. It saves you time: You’re too busy running your clinic to have time to keep up with supplement expiration dates. MedPax’s dose packs are shipped fast and should be used within 60 days for optimum freshness."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
#MEDPAX PATIENTS CHILD FAQ
                             ; faqMedpaxPatientsQus1      ; How can MedPax help me?                                                                                                     ; "Patients that use MedPax stick with it. According to surveys, those that opt for autoship are 300 times more likely to comply with their supplement protocol."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqMedpaxPatientsQus2      ; How else is MedPax helpful?                                                                                                 ; " Dose packs make it easy to see whether you’ve taken your supplements. It saves you space: No bottles all over your counters. It saves you time: No more trying to remember if you took your supplements. For households with more than 1 MedPax patient, your dose packs come personalized with your name printed on each packet."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
#SPECIAL OFFERS FAQ
                             ; faqSpecialOffersQus1       ; Is your promotional discount displaying correctly?                                                                          ; "All discount considerations are determined based on a per-item basis after being placed in your shopping cart. Please contact Customer Service directly at 1-800-647-6100 should you find any discrepancy in your grand total before finalizing your purchase as refund restrictions and prohibitions will apply after an order has been placed."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqSpecialOffersQus2       ; Is your account qualified to receive this promotional discount?                                                             ; "Discounts are contracted through our Sales and Marketing teams. If a promotional code was not offered directly through your practitioner, your account may not be eligible for the promotional price."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqSpecialOffersQus3       ; Does your promotional code include the qualifying products?                                                                 ; "Each promotional code has its own specific terms and conditions. These terms and conditions may be found in the disclaimer at the bottom of each promotional offer, which can be accessed by following the details link."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqSpecialOffersQus4       ; Is your promotional code entered correctly?                                                                                 ; "Our system is unique and will only recognize a promotional offer if the characters entered are associated with a specific promotional code. Please review what has been entered to ensure it is correct."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqSpecialOffersQus5       ; Why doesn’t my promotional code work?                                                                                       ; " Please read the details and disclaimers for each promotion carefully to ensure you have selected one or more qualifying products, you have entered the promotional code correctly, and that the promotion itself has not yet expired. Do not finalize your purchase as refund restrictions and prohibitions will apply after an order has been placed. Contact Customer Service directly at 1-800-647-6100 should you have any questions or concerns."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqSpecialOffersQus6       ; Have you used this promotional code before?                                                                                 ; "The promotional code you are using may have a limitation placed on it, such as “one-time use.” You can determine if any limitations apply by reading the terms and conditions found at the bottom of the promotional offer."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqSpecialOffersQus7       ; Is a referral code and a promotional code the same thing?                                                                   ; " No. A referral code is provided by a practitioner for you to use to register for an account and is only needed at the time you create your account. Promotional codes are special use codes provided under special circumstances, such as events, product launches, and sales, which are inputted during checkout, and which are subject to the terms and conditions found at the bottom of the promotional offer."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqSpecialOffersQus8       ; How do I get/qualify for a promotion/discount?                                                                              ; "Promotions are offered at the discretion of WholeScripts. Current promotions applicable to your account are available on WholeScripts.com. Only wholesale accounts are eligible to request promotional codes and discounts."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
#API FAQ
                             ; faqAPIQus1                 ; What is the WholeScripts API program, and what benefits does it offer?                                                      ; "The WholeScripts API program is a program that aims to simplify e-commerce operations and streamline patient recommendations. It offers various benefits, including expanded e-commerce marketability, MedPax® inclusion, plug-and-play capability (with pre-integrated systems), and system integration."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqAPIQus2                 ; How can I get started with the WholeScripts API program?                                                                    ; "Email us at <a href='mailto:integrations@wholescripts.com'>integrations@wholescripts.com</a> to schedule a meeting with one of our integration specialists."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqAPIQus3                 ; What resources do I need to integrate my e-commerce solution or website with WholeScripts?                                  ; "If you are integrating your website or e-commerce solution with WholeScripts, you will need a web developer to work on the integration."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqAPIQus4                 ; Where can I learn more about your API documentation?                                                                        ; "You can access the <a href='/api'>WholeScripts API documentation here.</a>"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
#SHIPPING FAQ
                             ; faqShippingQus1            ; What shipping methods are used for standard shipping?                                                                       ; "WholeScripts.com ships standard orders using USPS Priority and UPS Ground. At its discretion, WholeScripts may use another carrier and/or method to ship orders."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqShippingQus2            ; Does the shipping policy include all US states?                                                                             ; "Standard shipping is available for all fifty (50) states, Puerto Rico (PR), and the Virgin Islands (VI)."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqShippingQus3            ; What happens if there are errors in the shipping address or if it is undeliverable?                                         ; "WholeScripts.com will attempt to validate your shipping address before your order is submitted and, if necessary, provide a recommended substitution. If the carrier encounters errors or the address is undeliverable, fees may be assessed for address corrections and/or package rerouting."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqShippingQus4            ; As a patient, what are the shipping rates for orders placed online, via email, or by phone?                                 ; "Orders totaling $100 or more qualify for free standard shipping. Orders totaling $99.99 or less have a shipping cost of $11.95 for standard shipping."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqShippingQus5            ; As a practitioner, what are the shipping rates for orders placed online?                                                    ; "Orders totaling $300 or more qualify for free standard shipping. Orders totaling $299.99 or less have a shipping cost of $11.95 for standard shipping."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup
                             ; faqShippingQus6            ; As a practitioner, what are the shipping rates for orders placed via email or phone?                                        ; "Orders totaling $300 or more qualify for free standard shipping. Orders between $100 and $299.99 have a shipping cost of $11.95 for standard shipping. Orders totaling $99.99 or less have a shipping cost of $14.95 for standard shipping."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  ; practitionercustomergroup,patientcustomergroup,anonymousUserGroup

#AUTOSHIP FAQ
                             ; faqAutoShipQus1            ; How does AutoShip work?                                                                                                     ; "AutoShip is a convenient subscription service that allows you to receive your favorite WholeScripts products automatically at your preferred delivery frequency—every 30, 60, or 90 days. You simply select the AutoShip option when adding eligible products to your cart, and we’ll take care of the rest. You’ll be billed and shipped on the schedule you choose, with the ability to update or cancel anytime."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          ; practitionercustomergroup
                             ; faqAutoShipQus2            ; What happens if a product is out of stock?                                                                                  ; "If an item in your AutoShip order is out of stock at the time of your scheduled shipment, you will be notified via email. You won’t be charged for that item, and it won’t ship until it becomes available again. Your AutoShip schedule will continue as planned for any other in-stock items."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   ; practitionercustomergroup
                             ; faqAutoShipQus3            ; Are all WholeScripts products eligible for AutoShip?                                                                        ; "Most WholeScripts products are eligible for AutoShip, but some items may be excluded due to limited availability or special order requirements. Eligible products will have the AutoShip option available on their product page."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ; practitionercustomergroup
                             ; faqAutoShipQus4            ; Will I be notified before my AutoShip is delivered?                                                                         ; "Yes, you’ll receive a reminder email a few days before each scheduled AutoShip delivery. This gives you time to review, modify, or cancel the order if needed before it processes."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              ; practitionercustomergroup
                             ; faqAutoShipQus5            ; Is there free shipping available on AutoShips?                                                                              ; "Yes, free standard shipping is available on AutoShip orders that meet the minimum purchase requirement. Patients must spend $100 or more, and practitioners must spend $300 or more to qualify. For full details, please refer to our Terms & conditions."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   ; practitionercustomergroup
                             ; faqAutoShipQus6            ; How do I cancel my AutoShip?                                                                                                ; "You can cancel your AutoShip at any time by logging into your WholeScripts account. Go to the “AutoShip” page under your account dropdown menu, select the subscription you wish to cancel, and click “Cancel AutoShip.” No penalties or fees apply."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ; practitionercustomergroup


