INSERT_UPDATE CMSParagraphComponent; $contentCV[unique = true]; uid[unique = true]                   ; name                                               ; content
                                   ;                          ; TitleParagraph                       ; Title Paragraph Component                          ; "<h1>WholeScripts API Documentation</h1>"
                                   ;                          ; IntroParagraph                       ; Introduction Paragraph Component                   ; "<h2>Introduction</h2> <p>WholeScripts offers 2 categories of RESTful APIs: external order submission services and EMR recommendation services. Our order submission services facilitate third-party fulfillment from a practitioner's eStore, and our EMR services allow practitioners to send recommendations to their patients from inside the EMR software. Contact us for access to the test environment of either API category.</p>"
                                   ;                          ; OurApiParagraph                      ; Our Api Paragraph Component                        ; "<h4>Our APIs</h4>"
                                   ;                          ; EmailParagraph                       ; Email Paragraph Component                          ; "<p>We’re here to help with any of your design or implementation questions.</p><p>Email us at <a class='api-mail' href='mailto:integrations@wholescripts.com'>integrations@wholescripts.com</a></p>"
                                   ;                          ; ExternalOrderSubmissionParagraph     ; External Order Submission Paragraph Component      ; "<h2>External Order Submission</h2>"
                                   ;                          ; LastUpdateParagraph                  ; Last Update Paragraph Component                    ; "<p>Latest update 2023/08/29</p>"
                                   ;                          ; ExternalOrderSubmissionBodyParagraph ; External Order Submission Body Paragraph Component ; "<p>Our external order submission APIs allow practitioners to transfer orders directly to our fulfillment system from their eStore. We provide product information and order status endpoints, including shipment tracking.</p>"
                                   ;                          ; EMRRecommendationsParagraph          ; EMR Recommendations Paragraph Component            ; "<h2>EMR Recommendations</h2>"
                                   ;                          ; EMRRecommendationsBodyParagraph      ; EMR Recommendations Body Paragraph Component       ; "<p>Our EMR recommendation services are designed to allow practitioners to send their patients recommendations from inside the EMR software. Our EMR API provides 2 methods to obtain authorization tokens, showcasing our commitment to data security. Our platform also offers comprehensive product information and endpoints for sending and listing recommendations and their statuses.</p>"

#################### END - CCW-311 API Resources Page ####################

