                                   ;                          ; AboutUsParaComponent       ; About Us Paragraph Component              ; About Us
                                   ;                          ; AboutUsPoweredParaComp     ; About Us Powered Paragrapgh Component     ; WholeScripts is powered by XYMOGEN.
                                   ;                          ; AboutUsFulfillmentParaComp ; About Us Fulfillment Paragrapgh Component ; In fact, WholeScripts is the fulfillment arm of XYMOGEN.
                                   ;                          ; AboutUsGoalParaComp        ; About Us Goal Paragrapgh Component        ; Our goal is to make WholeScripts your one-stop site for professional-grade nutritional and herbal supplements. WholeScripts was created to allow XYMOGEN’s manufacturing and fulfillment departments to concentrate on their functions and support our customers better.
                                   ;                          ; AboutUsStrategicParaComp   ; About Us Strategic Paragrapgh Component   ; This strategic alignment has allowed us to invest in infrastructure enhancements and make necessary software upgrades to keep up with demand and growth. But more importantly, this change will give all our customers an exceptional ordering experience.
                                   ;                          ; AboutUsInfoParaComp        ; About Us Information Paragrapgh Component ; For more information about XYMOGEN, visit <a href="https://www.xymogen.com/">XYMOGEN.com</a>. You may also contact us at <a href="tel:800-647-6100">800-647-6100</a>, <a href="mailto:marketing@xymogen.com">marketing@xymogen.com</a>.

INSERT_UPDATE BannerComponent; $contentCV[unique = true]; uid[unique = true]              ; name                               ; page(uid, $contentCV)[default = 'AboutUsPage']; media(code, $contentCV)  ; headline                                              ; content
                             ;                          ; GoodHealthBannerComponent       ; Good Health Banner Component       ;                                               ; health-icon              ; Everyone is entitled to good health.                  ; For decades, integrative medicine’s approach to nutritional supplementation has contributed to that goal. Through WholeScripts powered by XYMOGEN, we aim to strengthen and support the patient-practitioner relationship by offering a straightforward pathway to high-quality nutritional supplements for better health.
                             ;                          ; GradeSupplementsBannerComponent ; Grade Supplements Banner Component ;                                               ; xymogen-exclusivity-icon ; Top professional-grade supplements. All in one place. ; WholeScripts is dedicated to providing access to advanced XYMOGEN formulas--as well as other high-quality nutirional and herbal supplements--to patients and healthcare practitioners via an exceptional user-experience platform that supports their needs.
                             ;                          ; AboutUsPageBannerComponent      ; About Us Page Banner Component     ;                                               ; ws-image-aboutus-desktop2x  ;                                                       ;

