                                   ;                          ; ShopifyBodyContentSection1ParaComponent            ; ShopifyBodyContentSection1ParaComponent            ; Shopify Page Content Section1 Para Component         ; <h2>Streamline your orders with the WholeScripts Fulfillment App on Shopify</h2><p>Integrate the WholeScripts Fulfillment App into your Shopify store to simplify order processing and tracking by automating your workflow.</p>
                                   ;                          ; ShopifyBodyContentSection2ParaComponent            ; ShopifyBodyContentSection2ParaComponent            ; Shopify Page Content Section2 Para Component         ; <h1>How to Get Started</h1><p>Send product orders from Shopify using the WholeScripts Fulfillment App.</p><ol><li><strong>Sign up for our API Integrations program</strong><br>Log in to WholeScripts and visit our Shopify sign-up page to begin.</li><li><strong>Install the WholeScripts app from the Shopify App Store</strong><br>Download the WholeScripts app from the Shopify App Store and follow our installation guide.</li><li><strong>Import products using our product importer</strong><br>Start importing products from WholeScripts into your Shopify store.</li><li><strong>Manage and grow your online practice</strong><br>Enjoy the benefits of providing XYMOGEN formulas to your customers, with hourly inventory updates and tracking information for each line item.</li></ol>
                                   ;                          ; ShopifyBodyContentSection4ParaComponent            ; ShopifyBodyContentSection4ParaComponent            ; Shopify Page Content Section4 Para Component         ; <h1>Resources & Support</h1><ul><li>Visit Shopify to learn about its services</li><li>Install the WholeScripts Fulfillment App on Shopify</li><li>For more information, reach out to your WholeScripts representative or <a href="mailto:info@wholescripts.com">contact us</a>.</li></ul>

