UPDATE CMSParagraphComponent; $contentCV[unique = true]; uid[unique = true]                       ; content[lang = $lang]
                            ;                          ; WellProzBodyContentSection1ParaComponent ; "<h2>Create a Care Experience Your Patients Will Love</h2><p>We offer clinical lab testing, practitioner-grade supplements, your services, and more with shipping, fulfillment, and logistics all done for you in a single platform.</p><hr/>"
                            ;                          ; WellProzBodyContentSection2ParaComponent ; "<h3>How to Get Started</h3><p>Send product orders from your preferred e-store.</p><ol><li><strong>Visit Well Proz:</strong><br/>Learn how to set up and integrate with WholeScripts by visiting <a href='https://wellproz.zendesk.com/hc/en-us'>Well Proz</a> or contacting one of their Sales Representatives.</li><li><strong>Sign up for our API Integration program:</strong><br/>Log in to WholeScripts and visit our <a href='/integrations-hub/estore-settings'>e-Store Integration sign-up page</a> to start the integration process.</li><li><strong>Generate e-store credentials:</strong><br/>Share your e-store credentials with your Well Proz representative to finalize the integration.</li><li><strong>Manage and grow your online practice:</strong><br/>Enjoy the benefits of providing XYMOGEN formulas to your customers. </li></ol>"
                            ;                          ; WellProzBodyContentSection3ParaComponent ; "<h3>How It Works</h3><ul><li>All orders from your e-store will be created under your WholeScripts practitioner account.</li><li>We will bill you for the order at wholesale pricing minus any discounts on your account, plus shipping and applicable taxes.</li><li>Orders are billed according to your terms or the default API credit card on file for your account.</li></ul><hr/>"
                            ;                          ; WellProzBodyContentSection4ParaComponent ; "<h3>Resources & Support</h3><ul><li><a href='https://wellproz.com/'>Visit Well Proz</a> to learn about its services and integration process.</li><li>For more information, reach out to your WholeScripts representative or <a href='mailto:integrations@wholescripts.com'>contact us</a>.</li></ul><hr/>"
                            ;                          ; WellProzBodyContentSection5ParaComponent ; "<h3>FAQs</h3><ul><li><strong>I am new to Well Proz, where can I learn more about it?</strong><br/><a href='https://wellproz.com/'>Visit Well Proz</a> for the latest information about its products and services.</li><li><strong>Where do I set up my e-store on WholeScripts?</strong><br/>In your WholeScripts account, go to your account menu and visit the <a href='/integrations-hub/estore-settings'>My e-Store Integrations page</a>.You can sign the integration agreement, set up credentials for your e-stores, and select a default credit card for all your API orders.</li><li><strong>I generated the credentials for my e-store, what do I do next?</strong><br/>Contact your Well Proz representative to start the integration process.  </li><li><strong>What can I see on your e-store integration page?</strong><br/>You can generate multiple e-store credentials, such as for your own e-store or from our e-store partners.You can assign a credit card exclusively for e-store orders that won’t affect your WholeScripts orders and also review pending order status.</li></ul>"

