UPDATE CMSParagraphComponent; $contentCV[unique = true]; uid[unique = true]                         ; content[lang = $lang]
                            ;                          ; GetHealthyPageHeadingSectionParaComponent  ; "<h2>An Online Store Experience Like No Other</h2><p>GetHealthy is an integrated e-commerce and marketing platform for next-generation practitioners. We help practitioners grow their influence and revenue through increased engagement with their patients and followers.</p><hr/>"
                            ;                          ; GetHealthyBodyContentSection1ParaComponent ; "<h3>How to Get Started</h3><p>Send product orders from your preferred e-store.</p><ol><li><strong>Visit GetHealthy:</strong><br/>Learn how to set up and integrate with WholeScripts by visiting <a href='https://providercommerce.lpages.co/gethealthy-sales/'>GetHealthy</a> or contacting one of their Sales Representatives.</li><li><strong>Sign up for our API Integration program:</strong><br/>Log in to WholeScripts and visit our <a href='/integrations-hub/estore-settings'>e-Store Integration sign-up page</a> to start the integration process.</li><li><strong>Generate e-store credentials:</strong><br/>Share your e-store credentials with your GetHealthy representative to finalize the integration.</li><li><strong>Manage and grow your online practice:</strong><br/>Enjoy the benefits of providing XYMOGEN formulas to your customers.</li></ol>"
                            ;                          ; GetHealthyBodyContentSection2ParaComponent ; "<h3>How It Works</h3><ul><li>All orders from your e-store will be created under your WholeScripts practitioner account.</li><li>We will bill you for the order at wholesale pricing minus any discounts on your account, plus shipping and applicable taxes.</li><li>Orders are billed according to your terms or the default API credit card on file for your account.</li></ul><hr/>"
                            ;                          ; GetHealthyBodyContentSection3ParaComponent ; "<h3>Resources & Support</h3><ul><li><a href='https://providercommerce.lpages.co/gethealthy-sales/'>Visit GetHealthy</a> to learn about its services and integration process.</li><li>For more information, reach out to your WholeScripts representative or <a href='mailto:integrations@wholescripts.com'>contact us</a>.</li></ul><hr/>"
                            ;                          ; GetHealthyBodyContentSection4ParaComponent ; "<h3>FAQs</h3><ul><li><strong>I am new to GetHealthy, where can I learn more about it?</strong><br/><a href='https://providercommerce.lpages.co/gethealthy-sales/'>Visit ProviderCommerce</a> for the latest information about its products and services.</li><li><strong>Where do I set up my e-store on WholeScripts?</strong><br/>In your WholeScripts account, go to your account menu and visit the <a href='/integrations-hub/estore-settings'>My e-Store Integrations page</a>. You can sign the integration agreement contract and set up credentials for your e-stores, and select a default credit card for all your API orders.</li><li><strong>I generated the credentials for my e-store, what do I do next?</strong><br/>Contact your GetHealthy representative to start the integration process.</li><li><strong>What can I see on your e-store integration page?</strong><br/>You can generate multiple e-store credentials, such as for your own e-store or from our e-store partners. You can assign a credit card exclusively for e-store orders that won’t affect your WholeScripts orders. You can also review pending orders and share SKU numbers of Private Label MedPax cartons and kits with your e-store partners.</li><li><strong>What do I do if I want to sell Private Label products from my store?</strong><br/>Contact your WholeScripts representative to get started with our Private Label Dropship program. Once the agreement is approved, contact your GetHealthy representative to help set up your private label products in your store. Private Label SKUs can be found on the Private Label Order page for reference.</li></ul>"

