INSERT_UPDATE CMSParagraphComponent; $contentCV[unique = true]; uid[unique = true]                   ; name                                             ; content
                                   ;                          ; IntegrationsHubHeaderParaComp        ; Integrations Hub Header paragrapgh Component     ; <h3>Integrations hub</h3><p>Connect and manage your integrations while we do the fulfillment for you.</p>
                                   ;                          ; EStoreSettingsParaComp               ; EStoreSettings paragrapgh Component              ; <h3>eStore settings</h3><p>Effortlessly connect your online store integration using our API.</p>
                                   ;                          ; StoreSettingsParaComp                ; StoreSettings paragrapgh Component               ; <h4>Store Settings</h4><p>Create or select store to view details and modify settings.</p>
                                   ;                          ; PaymentSettingsParaComp              ; Payment settings paragrapgh Component            ; <h4>Payment Settings</h4><p>Easily switch, add or update default card details for seamless transactions.</p>
                                   ;                          ; PrivateLabelMedpaxCartonParaComp     ; Private Label Medpax Carton paragrapgh Component ; <h4>Private Label Medpax Carton</h4><p>View Medpax carton availability and download images to share.</p>
                                   ;                          ; PrivateLabelWebkitsParaComp          ; Private Label Webkits paragrapgh Component       ; <h4>Private Label Web Kits</h4><p>View web kit availability and details.</p>
                                   ;                          ; PendingStoreOrdersParaComp           ; Pending Store Orders paragrapgh Component        ; <h4>Pending Store Orders</h4><p>Explore pending orders below for this store. For all orders for this store, review <a href="/order/history">Order History</a></p>
                                   ;                          ; ConnectYourOnlineStoreParaComp       ; Connect Your Online Store Para Comp              ; <h3>Connect Your Online Store with WholeScripts</h3><p>Effortlessly connect your online store to WholeScripts online store integration using our API. Experience the advantages of seamless order fulfillment and a streamlined process with our efficient dropshipping solution. Simply sending orders directly from your online store to our fulfillment process.</p>
                                   ;                          ; StreamlineYourOnlineStoreParaComp    ; Streamline Your Online Store Para Comp           ; <h3>Streamline Your Online Store Orders</h3><p>By integrating WholeScripts with your online store, you can conveniently adjust your default payment method and update your store credentials. Stay informed and up-to-date with real-time updates on order fulfillments. This seamless integration will make managing your online store a breeze.</p>
                                   ;                          ; ShopifySettingsParaComp             ; Shopify Settings Para Component                 ; <h3>Shopify settings</h3><p>Review the app installations process and let your business grow with our WholeScripts Fulfillment App on Shopify</p>
                                   ;                          ; StreamlineFulfillmentShopifyParaComp ; Streamline Fulfillment Shopify Para Comp         ; <h2>Streamline Fulfillment with WholeScripts on Shopify</h2><p>At WholeScripts, our focus is to improve your order fulfillment process with your Shopify store. We understand how valuable your time is as a practitioner, which is why we aim to simplify the management of order processing and tracking. With our WholeScripts app on Shopify, you can streamline your workflow and elevate your workload management by automating the transfer of orders from your Shopify store to WholeScripts and enjoy effortless order tracking. So whether you're a seasoned store owner or venturing into e-commerce for the first time, WholeScripts is here to unlock your store's full potential.</p>
                                   ;                          ; FaqHeaderComp                        ; Faq Header Component                             ; <h2>FAQ</h2>
                                   ;                          ; FaqQue1Comp                          ; Faq Que1 Component                               ; <p>Are there any charges associated with using WholeScripts Shopify App to send orders to WholeScripts for fulfillment?</p>
                                   ;                          ; FaqQue2Comp                          ; Faq Que2 Component                               ; <p>What payment process does WholeScripts use to fulfill orders received from my Shopify store?</p>
                                   ;                          ; FaqAns1Comp                          ; Faq Ans1 Component                               ; <p>No, there are no extra charges when using the WholeScripts Shopify App to send orders to WholeScripts for fulfillment. Any order you send is similar to placing an order on WholeScripts.</p>
                                   ;                          ; FaqAns2Comp                          ; Faq Ans2 Component                               ; <p>All orders sent from the Shopify store will be placed through your WholeScripts account. All orders must be paid for prior to fulfillment. When you sign our API Terms Agreement, you are required to have a credit card on file to process pending orders. If you have a "Net Terms" agreement with us, you will receive a bill for these orders just as you do for any other orders.</p>

