INSERT_UPDATE CMSParagraphComponent; $contentCV[unique = true]; uid[unique = true]               ; styleClasses        ; name                                                        ; content
                                   ;                          ; APIProgramInfoHeaderParaComp     ; apiProgInfoHeading  ; Integration Agreement APIProgramInfo Head para Component    ; <p>API Program Information</p>
                                   ;                          ; APIProgramInfoParaComp1          ; apiProgInfoContent  ; Integration Agreement APIProgramInfo paragrapgh Component 1 ; <ul><li>Application Programming Interfaces (APIs) are provided for practitioners to programmatically send orders from their own website to WholeScripts.com.</li><li>Orders are created under the practitioners’ wholesale account. As the sold-to/account owner, the practitioner is responsible for order payment. Any applicable discount will apply (SharedRewards).</li><li>All orders are dropship orders from the practitioner’s account to the patient's address.</li><li>Orders submitted through APIs are final, not test orders. Anything sent that does not get canceled before it reaches fulfillment will be shipped and charged.</li><li>All orders will be charged applicable taxes based on the wholesale price and the state where they are being shipped. A valid resale certificate must be on file for any state where the order is being shipped to avoid paying taxes.</li><li>All orders will be available for review on the Order History page on WholeScripts.com for status and tracking information.</li></ul>
                                   ;                          ; PaymentTermsHeaderParaComp       ; paymentTermsHeading ; Payment Terms Header Para Comp                              ; <p>Payment Terms</p>
                                   ;                          ; PaymentTermsParaComp             ; paymentTermsContent ; Payment Terms para Component                                ; <p>Payment terms for all new accounts will be credit card only. At this time, API orders cannot be charged automatically when the order is placed and must be charged manually when WholeScripts.com receives the order.<strong>Payment is required before order fulfillment.</strong> Special terms and limits must be requested through WholeScripts/XYMOGEN’s Finance Department.</p>
                                   ;                          ; APICreditCardHeaderAgreementPara ; apiCCHeading        ; API CreditCard Header Agreement Para                        ; <p>API Credit Card Agreement</p>
                                   ;                          ; APICreditCardAgreementPara1      ; apiCCContent1       ; API CreditCard Agreement Para1                              ; <p>The customer agrees to the established Credit Card Terms, and the following regulations shall apply:</p>
                                   ;                          ; APICreditCardAgreementPara2      ; apiCCContent2       ; API CreditCard Agreement Para2                              ; <ul><li><strong>The customer will not be assigned API Credentials unless a credit card is on file.</strong></li><li>The customer is required, at all times, to maintain a valid credit card on file.</li><li>The customer agrees that WholeScripts/XYMOGEN may charge any API order to the card on file designated for API orders.</li><li>Should the credit card on file need to be changed/updated, it is the customer’s responsibility to contact WholeScripts/XYMOGEN.</li><li>WholeScripts/XYMOGEN may, at any time, revoke the customer’s ordering privileges and block orders if payment is not received.</li></ul>
                                   ;                          ; APIProgramInfoParaComp2          ;                     ;API Program Info ParaComp2                             ; <p>Orders submitted through APIs are final, not test orders. Anything sent that does not get canceled before it reaches fulfillment will be shipped and charged.All orders will be charged applicable taxes based on the wholesale price and the state where they are being shipped. A valid resale certificate must be on file for any state where the order is being shipped to avoid paying taxes.All orders will be available for review on the Order History page on WholeScripts.com for status and tracking information.</p>
                                   ;                          ; SelectCreditCardHeaderComp       ;                     ; Select Credit Card Para Comp                                ; <p>Select a credit card on file for API orders</p>
                                   ;                          ; SelectCreditCardParaComp         ;                     ; Select Credit Card Para Comp                                ; <p>Credit cards may only be added over the phone at 1 (800) 647-6100 or in the Payments page.Need to add a new credit card?<a href="/accounts-settings/Payment">Go to Payments page</a></p>

