                         ;                          ; ExternalOrderSubmissionPage     ; External Order Submission                                    ; Our external order submission APIs allow practitioners to transfer orders directly to our fulfillment system from their eStore and track shipment statuses       ; "eStore; API; fulfillment system; external order submission; order status; shipment tracking; transfer orders; product information"
                         ;                          ; EMRRecommendationsPage          ; EMR Recommendation Status                                    ; Allow practitioners to send dietary supplement recommendations from inside the EMR software with confidence and increased data security measures                 ; "EMR; electronic medical records; API; EMR recommendation services; authorization tokens; data security"
                         ;                          ; contactUSPage                   ; WholeScripts | Contact Us                                    ; Need support? Contact us by filling out this form, calling, or emailing. Our friendly customer service representatives are here to help.                         ; "contact us; customer service; 2 days; 2 business days; complete the form; call us; email; customer service representative; here to help; need support"
                         ;                          ; TermsAndConditionsPage          ; WholeScripts | Terms and Conditions                          ; When visiting or shopping on WholeScripts, you accept our Terms and Conditions. Read on to learn about copyright, cancellations, refunds, NFR, and disclaimers   ; "T&C; terms and conditions; shipping; copyright; cancellations; refunds; not for resale; NFR; disclaimer"
