INSERT_UPDATE CMSParagraphComponent; $contentCV[unique = true]; uid[unique = true]              ; name                                            ; content
                                   ;                          ; DonotSellPersonalDataHeaderPara ; Do not Sell Personal Data Header Para Component ; "<h1>DO NOT SELL OR SHARE MY PERSONAL INFORMATION</h1>"
                                   ;                          ; BodyParagraphComponent1         ; Body Paragraph Component 1                      ; "<p>Depending on your state of residence, you may have the right to opt-out of the sale and sharing of your Personal Information (see California Privacy Policy for definition), which may include, but may not be limited to, your name, postal and e-mail address, and any other personal identifying information. WholeScripts LLC., does not sell your Personal Information in exchange for compensation; however, WholeScripts.com does use cookies and other trackers, which may collect personal information to be used for cross-context behavior advertising and/or targeted advertising. This activity may be considered a sale, sharing, and/or processing of personal information under certain state laws. For more information on how WholeScripts, LLC., may share your Personal Information with third parties, visit our Privacy Policy. Please be advised: Your right to opt out is subject to exceptions; for example, it does not apply to certain types of cookies and trackers used for analytics and other business purposes. If you have questions regarding the information provided herein, please contact <b>privacy@wholescripts.com.</b></p>"
                                   ;                          ; BodyParagraphComponent2         ; Body Paragraph Component 2                      ; "<p>If you wish to exercise your rights to opt-out, please do so by:</p>"
                                   ;                          ; BodyParagraphComponent3         ; Body Paragraph Component 3                      ; "<ul><li> Declining cookies through the banner when you visit our website;</li><li> Calling toll-free at 1 (800) 647-6100; or</li><li> E-mailing privacy@wholescripts.com (include your full name, mailing address, the e-mail address associated with your account, and whether you are a patient or a practitioner).</li></ul>"
                                   ;                          ; BodyParagraphComponent4         ; Body Paragraph Component 4                      ; "<p>Once we receive your request, we will not share your Personal Information unless you later allow us to do so. We may ask for your permission to resume sharing your Personal Information at a later date, but we will wait at least twelve (12) months before doing so.</p>"
########################## END : Do not sell or share my personal information Page ########################################
